'  "(THE SEVEN-DAY THEORY. . .NOTE!!! '. . .the evening and the morning were the <i+1>-th <and -st, -nd, -rd> day. . .' 
     where i = 0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, AND 7. . .>)"



